<section class="page-head">
    <span class="auth-tag">ABOUT THE PLATFORM</span>
    <h1>The CodeQuest Mission</h1>
    <p>Bridging the gap between reading syntax manuals and developing true coding confidence through interactive practice.</p>
</section>

<section class="section narrow">
    <div class="card about-card" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <h2>Interactive Learning by Doing</h2>
        <p>
            Traditional computer science education often leans heavily on static reading and passive video lectures. 
            <strong>CodeQuest</strong> was designed from the ground up as an interactive challenge platform: learners test their understanding 
            with focused, timed quizzes, inspect explanations for every question, maintain daily practice streaks, and receive contextual AI hints.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid two">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>🏗 Architecture & Technology</h3>
            <ul class="clean-list">
                <li><strong>Framework:</strong> ASP.NET Core (.NET 10) MVC with C#</li>
                <li><strong>Database:</strong> Microsoft SQL Server LocalDB with parameterized queries</li>
                <li><strong>Security:</strong> PBKDF2 with SHA-256 cryptographic password hashing and salt</li>
                <li><strong>AI Guidance:</strong> Deterministic algorithmic tutoring system providing conceptual hints</li>
                <li><strong>Styling:</strong> Responsive modern CSS3 with glassmorphic cards and typography</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>👥 Roles & Capabilities</h3>
            <ul class="clean-list">
                <li><strong>Guests:</strong> Browse topics, explore curriculum, and view community leaderboard rankings.</li>
                <li><strong>Learners:</strong> Register with country/address, take timed quizzes, build streaks, and collect badges.</li>
                <li><strong>Administrators:</strong> Manage question banks, inspect user metrics, toggle user privileges, and sync repositories.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card about-card" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <h2>Database Connection</h2>
        <p>
            The platform is integrated with Microsoft SQL Server LocalDB (`(localdb)\MSSQLLocalDB`) using the <code>Microsoft.Data.SqlClient</code> library.
            Tables are automatically provisioned and seeded on application launch with no manual setup needed.
        </p>
        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <a href="/Account/Register" class="button primary">Join CodeQuest Now →</a>
            <a href="/Community" class="button secondary" style="margin-left: 10px;">Check Community Leaderboard</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
